  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint Venture between ATEC and iDE Bangladesh to scale-up ATEC&#x2019;s successful, world-leading biodigester technology in Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ATEC is a social enterprise that produces, sells and distributes the world&apos;s first plug-and-play biodigester for small-scale farmers, combined with patented PAYGo technology.The partnership between ATEC Biodigesters International, iDE Bangladesh and IDCOL Partner Organisations intends to reach one million people in Bangladesh with clean cooking by 2030, including 100,000 people by the end of 2023.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The partnership plans to sell 19.870 biodigesters in four years.</narrative>
  </description>
